
@startuml

title Assignment 4 - Statistics Sequence Diagram

autonumber

actor "Kattis Judge" as Judge
participant "statistics_main.py" as Main
participant "StatisticsSolution" as Solution
participant "StatisticsValues" as Values
participant "stdin" as Input
participant "stdout" as Output

Judge -> Main: Execute program
activate Main

Main -> Solution: StatisticsSolution(stdin, stdout)
activate Solution

note right of Solution
  Inherits StatisticsTemplate.run()
  and the professor's Kattis ABC
end note

Main -> Solution: run()

group Template Method Pattern
    Solution -> Solution: read_input()

    loop For each input case
        Solution -> Input: Read next line
        Input --> Solution: Count and integers
        Solution -> Values: StatisticsValues(integers)
        Values --> Solution: Parsed values
    end

    Solution -> Solution: solve()

    loop For each test case
        Solution -> Values: minimum
        Values --> Solution: Minimum value

        Solution -> Values: maximum
        Values --> Solution: Maximum value

        Solution -> Values: spread
        Values --> Solution: Maximum - minimum

        Solution -> Solution: Format "Case N: min max range"
    end

    Solution -> Solution: print_answer()
    Solution -> Output: Write formatted answers
end

Output --> Judge: Case 1: 4 10 6

Solution --> Main: Complete
deactivate Solution
deactivate Main

@enduml
